8 "33-1-404. Severability of provisions.
9
10 The provisions of this article shall be severable and if any
11 phrase, clause, sentence or provision of this article is declared
12 to be unconstitutional or the applicability of this article to any
13 state, agency, person or circumstance is held invalid, the
14 constitutionality of this act and the applicability to any other
15 state, agency person or circumstance shall, with respect to all
16 severable matters, not be affected.". RODRIGUEZ-WILLIAMS, CHAIRMAN
